  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indigenous communicators building citizenship in community media.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Several grassroots organizations in Central America face challenges to manage their community-based media outlets. Asociacin Sobrevivencia Cultural (ASC) promotes best practices to run community-based media outlets and combines best practices to develop a regional strategic plan that strengthens the Central American community-based media movement. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to strengthen governance in Guatemala. ASC&apos;s activities strengthen excluded communities so they can improve their living conditions and participate equally in a nation&apos;s political, economic, and social life. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
